  "description": "Journeyer ESSA 1x8 is made to be your gateway to gravel riding; it's a versatile gravel adventure bike that can keep up with your gravel races, backroad wandering, and even a little light bikepacking. Journeyer is designed around comfortable upright geometry that feels confident and comfortable even on rough gravel roads (and gives you a better view of the scenery). The aluminum frame and fork feature mounts for fenders, racks, and accessories like our EXP-R Series Trillium Top Tube Bag, so you can adapt it for any adventure. The Shimano ESSA 1x8 components are reliable enough for your most remote rides and have plenty of gear range for comfortable pedaling on steep climbs and long flats. Journeyer’s versatility and comfort make it the best gravel adventure bike for riders starting to explore lesser-traveled roads.",
